## Next step

Implementation is complete. User acceptance may start by opening the saved
`102.png` review, comparing the source image, baseline, candidate and diff, then
choosing `Принять`, `Оставить исходный` or `Отложить`. For a larger pilot,
filter `С замечаниями`, select up to ten representative files and create Terra
candidates; completed reviews are durable and will not spend the model again
after reopening or restarting. Do not start the earlier 101-160 OCR correction
batch automatically. Current rollback source:
